WEBVTT

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.000
Hey, guys, you're probably still anxious,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.120
but I know you'll get back on your feet
by focusing on one show at a time!

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.540
You're making your hack face again.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.910
What face is that?

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:34.410
At least you can still talk back.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:39.120
Tenten! We've got your back if anything happens!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.160
And I'll do my best
to do everything you taught me!

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.830
You guys...

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:49.450
Tenma, you can borrow my triangle.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:50.910
A triangle ruler?

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:55.950
My good luck charm. My most precious triangle!

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.540
Thanks.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:02.450
Listen, I've got an idea
for Summer Troupe's huddle.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.620
Huddle?

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.330
Hey, wait, wh--

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.000
Guys, get around Tenten.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:14.290
What the heck?

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:17.620
We're wishing that you'll
perform like you normally do.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.450
Cringe.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.500
Come on, just this once, Yuki.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.500
Yeah, come on!

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:30.660
Ready, go... Summer Troupe, fight!

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:33.120
Yeah!

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.370
That was my first huddle.

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.660
Seriously? How'd it feel?

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.700
Embarrassing.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:40.870
Aw.

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:42.410
I told you.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:48.450
But it wasn't bad. I forgot
my stage fright for a sec.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.290
Tenma looks ready!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.330
I'm sure you'll be fine now!

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.250
I hope so.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.160
Everyone! Five minutes to curtain!

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.120
Okay, guys.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.000
Let's go.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:09.410
Welcome, and thank you for joining us

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:12.540
"Summertime Survival!"
Welcome, and thank you for joining us

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.120
"Summertime Survival!"
for Mankai Company Summer Troupe's
production of <i>Water me!</i>

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:19.580
for Mankai Company Summer Troupe's
production of <i>Water me!</i>

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.750
Please enjoy the show!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.950
Hack.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.330
Tonight I have another tale to share with you.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:04.040
One of a thousand tales
that capture the imagination.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:10.160
His name is Ali Baba, a poor, hardworking
young man who dreams of becoming rich.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.080
And I am...

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:17.200
Tell me, Scheherazade!
Where is the legendary paradise Oasis?!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.450
Then I will spin another tale for you tonight.
Long ago, in a faraway land--

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.700
Just cut to the chase!
Give it to me in four words or less!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.830
Aladdin. Magic lamp. Magician.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.830
Great, be right back!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.500
Better rhythm and pacin' for theater now.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.200
Be careful out there, Ali Baba!

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:38.620
You've never been one to listen to others.
It's your biggest flaw.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.160
Tenma's his usual self!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.040
Yukki's in the zone, too!

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.160
Maintain the pace I set.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.830
Okay!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:50.700
I gotta say, you're a real cutie-pie.
Ooh, she's real cute, too!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.200
Hey, wanna hang out?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.790
Hey!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.660
You Aladdin?

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.250
Aladdin? You're talking to him!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.160
Hand over the magic lamp!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.620
Oh, hm...

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.950
--Whaddya think? I'm performing
like you taught me how to, right, Tenten?

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.000
--Actually, you've got the wrong person.
--Whaddya think? I'm performing
like you taught me how to, right, Tenten?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.500
--See ya!
--H-Hey wait!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:14.910
The audience looks as if they've
found the best triangles!

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:16.540
Now...

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.290
...it's my turn!

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.290
Come out, genie!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:29.950
I am a genie, and I shall grant you
three wishes. Name them.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.500
Yeowch! My butt's on fire!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:38.330
Can't you tell what I want?! Do something
about the magician and the serpent!

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:40.410
The magician and the serpent?

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:46.750
Dealing with both will use two of your wishes.
Is that what you wish for?

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.080
Whatever, just do it!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.080
So be it.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.330
Genie?

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.870
Nobody can take their eyes off you, Sumi!

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.450
It's 'cause you suggested me to do it!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:20.750
Theater's so fun!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.950
Now, tell me your third wish.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.450
--Oasis! Oasis! Oasis!

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.160
--Um...
--Oasis! Oasis! Oasis!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.370
I wanna go on a date with
the girl I met in town!

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.450
What?!

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.040
So be it.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.700
All your wishes have been granted.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.540
Farewell!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.870
Wait--

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.750
--Come back! Hey!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.040
--You're going to become a prince, right?
--Come back! Hey!

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:48.200
Show them your new dream, Muku.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.540
Yeah!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.290
I'm no sailor. You have the wrong person.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:57.950
You'll do! Come on a journey
with me to find Oasis.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.750
A journey?! Do you even know where it is?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.040
Don't you know?

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.410
How would I know?

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:08.620
You're Sinbad, aren't you--

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.000
He forgot his line?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.620
Shoot!

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:21.700
I don't know where the gold is.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:27.750
Oh, grow up, Ali Baba.
There <i>is </i>no legendary paradise.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:31.250
N-Nope, don't wanna hear it!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.450
Muku saved it!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.450
Tenten pulled himself together!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.620
Muku, you really saved me there.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.910
I was about to make
all our hard work go to waste!

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.290
Don't worry, Tenma!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:48.580
All of your friends in Summer Troupe
are here with you on this stage!

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:52.450
Sheesh, what a handful of a leader.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:07:00.040
Finding out that Oasis doesn't exist,
Ali Baba goes to question Scheherazade.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:04.950
Scheherazade lies to avoid
the king's marriage proposal,

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.910
saying that she'd only wed
one who has found Oasis.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:12.250
I've stalled things so far,
but my hands are tied now.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.790
I must join the king's harem.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:16.620
Is that what you want?!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:23.120
Of course it isn't. But I don't
get a say in the matter!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.200
Why didn't you tell me sooner?!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.040
If you'd just talked to me instead of
making up some cockamamie tale--

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.620
Could you have changed things?

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.790
Well, I dunno, but...

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:37.120
It doesn't matter now anyway. Forget about me.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:40.830
Tell the genie you wish to be rich.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:43.330
How can you be so stupid?!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:48.080
If that's how it's gonna be,
I really am done with you!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.000
Your momma's a poopy head!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.120
Why do you always have to be so childish?

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:02.250
Man... Why didn't Scheherazade tell me anything?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:08.040
Is she really gonna join the king's harem?

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:11.250
If she does, I'll never see her again...

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.950
Why did you come here, you idiot?!

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:21.410
Don't ask me, I don't know!

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:31.410
Well, Master? What is your final wish?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.660
For my final wish...

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:45.540
I see. I understand now.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:51.040
I finally get what the director meant.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.750
...I wish that Scheherazade
couldn't marry the king!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:57.620
What?!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.580
So be it!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.620
You two are now wed.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.910
Ali Baba and I are wed?!

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:07.450
If you are wed, you can't join the king's harem.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:10.870
May you both live happily ever after!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:17.540
What are you, stupid?!
You used up all the genie's wishes?

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:20.910
I thought your whole dream
was to strike it rich!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.580
Even if there is no Oasis,

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:28.290
I could never sleep soundly at night
without your bedtime stories, okay?

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.540
Ali Baba...

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.370
What?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:38.410
I'm thirsty. Go draw me some water... darling.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:41.450
What? Why should I?!

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:44.000
Tonight I have another tale to share with you.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.540
One of a three-year-old Ali Baba
wetting the bed--

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.790
Wait, no! No!

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:50.790
You have ten seconds.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.620
I'll get your damn water, jeez!

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:56.250
Maybe I rushed into this too fast...

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.000
Yay!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.790
The applause is deafening!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.910
Clap, clap!

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.750
We're done?

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:15.450
Wow, that was awesome!
Talk about feeling accomplished!

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.620
You'll understand once you get on stage.

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.540
This performance will only happen once.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:24.790
The audience comes to see a show
that will only ever happen once.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.870
Tenma! Curtain call!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.080
R-Right.

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:35.040
Thank you very much!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.080
Thanks.

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.250
Thanks a bunch!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.330
Thanks!

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.790
Great work, guys!

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.910
Thanks.

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:14.000
Now we've redeemed ourselves
from dress rehearsal.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.250
It was a close call for the hack, though.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:20.870
Anyway, we saved it, so it's all good!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.450
Muku... you really saved me. Thanks.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.250
Tenma...

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:30.790
Um, I'm sorry I said all those
harsh things to you way back.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:38.700
It's okay. I could perform so confidently
only because of all you taught me.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:42.080
I should be thanking you.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.870
I've still got more to teach you.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:45.830
Just can't ditch that arrogance, huh?

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:51.450
He saved me earlier, but I still have
loads more experience than him as an actor!

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:52.500
Fine, okay.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.120
What's with that attitude?

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.250
Back to your usual self, huh?

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.040
Tenma's back!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:03.080
But you know, we pulled it off today
thanks to the huddle I came up with.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.000
We're gonna keep doing that?

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.500
Yeah, let's keep doing it for good luck!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:08.700
Embarrassing.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.200
What?!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.080
Let's keep this up all the way
to closing night, guys!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.080
Yeah!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.370
You've got to keep it together, hack.

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:24.040
You don't have remind me.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.750
This is the reception area
for Summer Troupe's performance!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.500
Thank you for coming!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.910
E-Excuse me!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.450
Tenma's manager?

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:55.370
Tenma, it's bad! Your parents are here!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.330
What?! Shouldn't they both overseas right now?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:02.830
They made time between shoots
to see your last performance!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.000
Tenten's parents are here to watch?! Yikes!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.950
What the heck?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:11.830
I sent them tickets through their agency.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:12.830
You sent them?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:16.200
Prove to your parents
through tonight's performance

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:20.950
that this play is major step
for your career as an actor!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.330
Tenma.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.290
You're not a hack anymore, right?

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.290
I was never a hack.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:33.870
Yeah. I'll make them agree that turning down
the movie offer was the right choice.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.950
Oh, the track team's here.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.000
What should I do?

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:50.290
What do you mean? You're the one
who invited them, right?

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:55.410
Yeah, but seeing them makes me nervous.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.910
What's the matter?

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:01.290
Nothing.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.870
Oh, it's those guys.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:08.250
I didn't think they'd actually show up.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:12.580
Gone! I can't find my triangle...

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.160
You mean your triangle ruler?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:19.040
Yeah, I saw it this morning, but now it's gone.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.290
So sad...

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:24.250
Ah, now you've got me all nervous, too!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:26.910
Hello!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:28.200
'Sup.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.660
Welcome!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.120
You mean "excuse me."

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.580
What's up, guys?

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.200
Giving moral support.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:38.870
We thought everyone might be
nervous since it's closing night.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:41.700
Well, you're a winner as long as you have fun.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.330
We failed, though.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:46.540
Are you talking about me?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.580
I found this earlier!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:53.000
Triangle! Grandpa's triangle!

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.620
Sumi, that's great!

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.750
Nibble the thanks in the dud!

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.450
That makes no sense!

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:03.870
A carefree lot with heads full of
blooming flowers, as usual.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.750
I'm still thankful.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.660
Yeah.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:10.540
Tenma, how are you feeling?

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.700
It's a big responsibility to be lead.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:17.700
Now that I've come this far,
I respect you even more.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.200
What?! Respect me?!

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.120
Were you scared on closing night, too?

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:24.700
Well, yeah.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:28.790
To be honest, I was scared. Really scared.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:33.410
But I was as excited as I was scared!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.870
I see. Same here.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:40.290
I knew you could make this show happen, Tenma.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.370
I still feel the same way today,
on closing night.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:45.000
Of course!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.080
That's the spirit! The show must go on!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.580
I know you can do it, Tenma!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.580
Yeah, we'll pull through!

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.330
Hey, guys, curtain-up in a few!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.080
Yuki.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.080
What?

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:03.950
Muku.

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.040
Huh?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.080
Kazunari.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.500
What's up?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.450
Misumi.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:10.290
Yeah?

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:15.830
I'm glad to be on stage with you guys.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:21.250
You guys are all really important to me,
and I consider you all my friends.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:26.660
Kazunari, when you said you were my friend,

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:30.200
I was embarrassed,
but I was actually really happy.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.330
Tenten...

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:34.830
Sorry I said you're shallow during camp.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:37.160
No probs!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:41.160
Let's make this last show the best performance!

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:46.700
The best performance that only we
can do now, at this very moment.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.750
Will you follow my lead?

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.250
Of course.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.080
Yes, of course!

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.830
Let's bring the house down!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:57.290
I'll follow Tenma!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.790
All right.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:02.120
Summer Troupe, fight!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.080
Yeah!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:16.370
Tonight I have another tale to share with you.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:21.790
One of a thousand tales
that capture the imagination.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:26.000
Why're you spacing out, Scheherazade?

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.870
What? An ad-lib?

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.620
That kid...

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.040
Hey, hack, you listening?

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:35.500
You're the hack, you broke pauper!

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:37.500
You followed my lead.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.500
Well, duh. Do you know
how many times I've had to keep up

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:44.830
with pompous Mr. Arrogant
all the way from day one?

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.580
--Aw that's brutal!
--Man, Tenten! You're ad-libbing like crazy!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.040
--You're just getting
turned down left and right.
--Man, Tenten! You're ad-libbing like crazy!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:50.910
--You're just getting
turned down left and right.
--Should I tone it down?

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:51.830
--You just took over Aladdin's
Secret Love Technique #118!
--Should I tone it down?

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.450
--You just took over Aladdin's
Secret Love Technique #118!
--Nah!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:56.200
--You just took over Aladdin's
Secret Love Technique #118!
--This is hella fun! Can't stop here!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.000
--That's <i>way </i>too many!
--This is hella fun! Can't stop here!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:58.750
--I never imagined that I'd ever perform
in front of this huge audience.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:04.950
--What? I've never heard of a Sinbad
who's not a sailor. You in the right story?
--I never imagined that I'd ever perform
in front of this huge audience.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.750
--Don't worry, I'm from
the original source material.
--I never imagined that I'd ever perform
in front of this huge audience.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.700
--Don't worry, I'm from
the original source material.
--I'm glad I mustered up
my courage to start theater.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.450
--Originally, the sailor Sinbad
actually transported cargo--
--I'm glad I mustered up
my courage to start theater.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:12.750
--Originally, the sailor Sinbad
actually transported cargo--
--Your courage saved me.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.040
--Stop! That's too meta!
We'll lose all the fantasy!
--Your courage saved me.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.910
--Stop! That's too meta!
We'll lose all the fantasy!
--You guys taught me that there's
no need to be afraid of theater.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.540
--You guys taught me that there's
no need to be afraid of theater.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:19.750
Hup!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.580
Grandpa!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:28.500
--I am a genie, and I shall
grant you three wishes.
--Would my performance make him happy
if he were alive to see me now?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.290
I'm sure he'd be happy.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:35.950
Look at the huge grin on your face
and on everyone else's faces!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.790
Tonight I have another tale to share with you.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.450
One of a three-year-old Ali Baba
wetting the bed...

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.160
What?! Noo!

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:50.410
You have ten seconds.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:53.120
I'll get your damn water, jeez!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.750
Maybe I rushed into this too fast!

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:56.200
Argh!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:59.000
Thanks, Ali Baba.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.330
Huh?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.950
Scheherazade's last line was so moving!

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.910
Yeah, it was great!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.200
Whoa, I've got goosebumps! Holy crap!

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:34.000
A standing ovation!
I'm so moved right now, I might--

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.500
Man, Tenten, you added way too much ad-libs.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.870
I did ask if you guys could follow my lead.

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:42.660
It was so fun! Theater's so fun!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:43.870
Got that right!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.750
Yeah!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.450
Thanks, Yuki.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.330
Gross.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.830
Why you--

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.250
Great work, guys!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:00.250
Thanks.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.450
Thank you, everyone!

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.250
The applause was amazing.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:08.330
It wouldn't let up.
Made me want to stay on stage forever!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.790
Tenma.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:20.080
Your parents just left to catch their flight.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.500
I see.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:25.160
They left a note for you.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:32.790
"We won't nag you anymore, so do as
you see fit. Come and try to surpass us."

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.450
Dad...

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:39.660
He also said to call more often.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.410
Got it.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:53.080
Oh, Sakyo! You came to watch?

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.580
What, you here to pay off your debt?

00:20:55.580 --> 00:21:00.660
Ah, no. I came to pick this up.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:03.700
I was doubtful after reading
reviews on your dress rehearsal,

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.660
but it looks like it was a success after all.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:09.950
But if you relax for even a second,
you'll quickly lose your audience--

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.540
Oh!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.450
What?

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.080
Please take this!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.000
What're you up to?

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:25.750
I've thought this for a while,
but don't you actually love this theater, too?

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:29.370
Make sure to come. I'll be expecting you!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:36.870
"Recruiting New Members"

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:41.000
"Recruiting New Members"
Starting to act like a decent general director.

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:22.660
Hey!

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:24.160
Huh?

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:32.410
Well, what's your damn problem?

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:39.250
I'm Banri Settsu,
undefeated 'round here, just like you!

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:43.290
Well, anyway...

00:23:43.290 --> 00:23:46.500
...I'm gonna beat the hell outta ya!
